╭─ keys and help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Ctrl-a keys                                                                                                          │
│   c      go to the console panel                                                                                     │
│   t      the sessions tree: every session, by group                                                                  │
│   p      the big picture: what every session is doing                                                                │
│   g      the agent spot: the session open in the cockpit                                                             │
│   /      find a session: type part of its name, Enter jumps                                                          │
│   s      find a session in a full tab: type part of its name, Enter jumps                                            │
│   n      start a new session                                                                                         │
│   $      a plain terminal in a new tab (for a dev server…), in the folder of the agent or session you're on; `exit`  │
│          closes it                                                                                                   │
│   |      split the agent or terminal tab you're on: a shell beside it, in the same folder; `exit` closes it          │
│   -      split the agent or terminal tab you're on: a shell below it, in the same folder; `exit` closes it           │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ j/k scroll · q close                                                                                                 │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
